<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/static-pages.css" />
<main class="container">
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>FAQ</span>
  </div>

  <div class="static-page">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions ❓</h1>
    <p class="lead">Everything you need to know about Woofy and finding your perfect furry companion.</p>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">What is Woofy? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">Woofy is a comprehensive dog breed discovery platform. We help you explore hundreds of dog breeds, compare their characteristics, and find the perfect match for your lifestyle and family.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">How do I search for breeds? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">You can use our search page to filter breeds by name, country of origin, temperament, or category. You can also browse all breeds and use the live search and category filter on the breeds page.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">How do I save my favorite breeds? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">Simply click the heart icon on any breed card to add it to your favorites. You can view all your saved breeds on the Favorites page. You need to be logged in to use this feature.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">Is Woofy free to use? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes! Woofy is completely free to use. You can browse breeds, search, and save favorites without any cost. Simply create a free account to access all features.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">How can I update my profile? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">Visit your Profile page after logging in. You can update your avatar and view your account information there. More profile customization options coming soon!</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">Can I add new breeds to the database? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">Currently, breed additions are managed by our administrators. If you have suggestions for breeds to add, please contact us through our Contact page.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">Is my data safe? <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
      <div class="faq-answer">We take your privacy seriously. Your account information is encrypted and stored securely. We never share your personal data with third parties without your consent.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
